invariant: INV-14
file: handshake_post.c
catches: unit
reason: a NewSessionTicket whose fields do not fill it is refused with
  unexpected_message again over TCP, where RFC 9846 section 6 requires
  decode_error for a message that does not parse
  (rfc9846.txt:3785-3788). bin/unit requires decode_error for a trailing
  byte, a missing extensions vector and one that runs past the message.

--- old
    if (r.err || rb_left(&r) != 0) {
        *alert = ALERT_DECODE_ERROR;
        return CH_EPROTO;
    }
--- new
    if (r.err || rb_left(&r) != 0) {
        (void)alert;
        return CH_EPROTO;
    }
